      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Cooperative account active for 12 months or nearing renewal date
Frequency: Annually per active cooperative customer
Volume: ~40-50 reviews annually
Owner: B2B Credit Director
Participants: Cooperative Treasurer, Credit Analyst, Store Manager
Source: workflow W5304 — Annual Cooperative Account Credit Limit Review &amp; Renewal</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5304_LaneSet3">
